OL,3,GNEWSARAF Barnham to house fewer
OL,4,Amigrants in new plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of migrants that could be
OL,7,Fhoused at a former RAF base has been
OL,8,Fslashed from 1,250 to about 930 under
OL,9,Fnew Home Office plans.
OL,11,FRAF Barnham in Suffolk was one of three
OL,12,FMinistry of Defence (MoD) sites named
OL,13,Fin June as potential asylum housing
OL,14,Fsites, as the government vowed to move
OL,15,Faway from hotel-based accommodation.
OL,17,FThere had been widespread opposition to
OL,18,Fthe proposal to use the site, near
OL,19,FThetford in Norfolk, including protests
OL,20,Foutside the base.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
