OL,3,GNEWSARAF Barnham to house fewer
OL,4,Amigrants in new plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office said it had revised a
OL,7,Fplanning application for the site to
OL,8,Freduce the number of migrants housed
OL,9,Fthere based on "ongoing assessment of
OL,10,Fthe site".
